OL,3,GNEWSAHow fashion returned to Scotland's
OL,4,Aformer national costume museum
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor years, Shambellie House near New
OL,7,FAbbey was home to Scotland's National
OL,8,FMuseum of Costume.
OL,10,FWhen that chapter ended in 2013 and its
OL,11,Fcontents were transferred to Edinburgh,
OL,12,Fmany people wondered if fashion would
OL,13,Fever return to the site.
OL,15,FNow, thanks to a surprising new
OL,16,Fpartnership, costumes are back inside
OL,17,Fthe historic building.
OL,19,FHowever, this time around the set-up is
OL,20,Fcompletely different.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
